        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If you take leave because of your own serious health condition or to care for a family member, we may require you to contact us every 30 days regarding the status of the condition and your intention to return to work. In addition, you must give notice as soon as practicable (within two business days if feasible) if the dates of leave change or are extended or initially were unknown.",
            "block_bbox": [
                339,
